#ASSERT `s 48A(6) the relevant contribution condition` (`a person` Man (Date 6 4 1945) (Date 1 1 2010)) EQUALS `s 44(1A)(b) the condition specified in Schedule 3, Part I, paragraph 5A`
-- (2): a man whose spouse was born before 6 April 1950; a woman whose wife was born before 6 April 1950 (unless section 51ZA(1) lifts it).
