-- (1): a married person whose spouse has attained pensionable age and satisfies the relevant contribution condition.
-- The spouse born 6 April 1950 needs paragraph 5A; the spouse born 1 January 1940 needs paragraph 5.
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 1 January 1940 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2005`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 1 January 1940 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2005`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) FALSE (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a person` Woman (Date 1 1 1956) (Date 6 4 2016)) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (1)(b)(i): the spouse "has attained pensionable age" on the day asked about, and not before it.
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2015) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) TRUE (Date 31 12 2014) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (2) is a bar on (1): a man whose spouse was born 1 January 1949 is shut out even when every condition of (1) holds.
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a man who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a woman born 1 January 1949 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2009`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A woman whose wife was born before 6 April 1950: shut out, unless section 51ZA(1) lifts the bar; if that is not known, the answer is not covered.
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a woman born 1 January 1949 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2009`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a woman born 1 January 1949 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2009`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a woman born 1 January 1949 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2009`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) NOTHING NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 48A(1) the married person is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a woman born 1 January 1949 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2009`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) NOTHING NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3): a civil partner whose contributing civil partner was born on or after 6 April 1950, has attained pensionable age and satisfies paragraph 5A.
#ASSERT `s 48A(3) the civil partner is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the contributions of the contributing civil partner` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 48A(3) the civil partner is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the contributions of the contributing civil partner` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 5 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48A(3) the civil partner is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the contributions of the contributing civil partner` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 48A(3) the civil partner is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the contributions of the contributing civil partner` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) FALSE (Date 1 1 2020) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48A(3) the civil partner is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the contributions of the contributing civil partner` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) TRUE (Date 31 12 2014) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (4): the weekly rate is that of paragraph 5 of Part 1 of Schedule 4.
#ASSERT `s 48A(4) the weekly rate of the Category B retirement pension in pounds` (JUST 110.5) EQUALS JUST 110.5
#ASSERT `s 48A(4) the weekly rate of the Category B retirement pension in pounds` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- (5): ceases on death or on otherwise ceasing to be married or in the civil partnership.
#ASSERT `s 48A(5) the person ceases to be entitled to the Category B retirement pension under section 48A` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 48A(5) the person ceases to be entitled to the Category B retirement pension under section 48A` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 48A(5) the person ceases to be entitled to the Category B retirement pension under section 48A` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (6A) and (6B): conversions that are not to be treated as ceasing.
#ASSERT `s 48A(6A) the person is treated as having ceased to be in a civil partnership` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48A(6A) the person is treated as having ceased to be in a civil partnership` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 48A(6B) the person is treated as having ceased to be married` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48A(6B) the person is treated as having ceased to be married` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
