#ASSERT `s 48AA(6) the relevant contribution condition` (`a person` Man (Date 6 4 1945) (Date 1 1 2010)) EQUALS `s 44(1A)(b) the condition specified in Schedule 3, Part I, paragraph 5A`
-- (2): as section 48A(2), for the former spouse.
