#ASSERT `s 48AA(2) subsection (1) does not confer a right on the person` (`a man who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a person` Woman (Date 6 4 1950) (Date 1 1 2015)) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
