-- (1): the person attained pensionable age before 6 April 2016 and before the dissolution; the former spouse attained it before the dissolution and satisfied the relevant condition.
-- The person attained it on 1 January 2013; the former spouse (born 6 April 1950) on 1 January 2015; the marriage was dissolved on 1 January 2018.
#ASSERT `s 48AA(1) the person whose marriage has been dissolved is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the former spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) (Date 1 1 2018) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 48AA(1) the person whose marriage has been dissolved is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the former spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) (Date 1 1 2018) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48AA(1) the person whose marriage has been dissolved is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the former spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) (Date 1 1 2018) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- Dissolved on 1 January 2014: the former spouse had not yet attained pensionable age (1 January 2015).
#ASSERT `s 48AA(1) the person whose marriage has been dissolved is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the former spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) (Date 1 1 2014) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Dissolved on 1 January 2013: the person had not yet attained it (the same day is not "before").
#ASSERT `s 48AA(1) the person whose marriage has been dissolved is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the former spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 1 January 1940 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2005`) (Date 1 1 2013) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48AA(1) the person whose marriage has been dissolved is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the former spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 1 January 1940 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2005`) (Date 2 1 2013) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (2) is a bar on (1).
#ASSERT `s 48AA(1) the person whose marriage has been dissolved is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the former spouse's contributions` (`a man who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 1 January 1949 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2014`) (Date 1 1 2018) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48AA(1) the person whose marriage has been dissolved is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the former spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a woman born 1 January 1949 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2009`) (Date 1 1 2018) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
