#ASSERT `s 48AA(3) the person whose civil partnership has been dissolved is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the former civil partner's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) (Date 1 1 2018) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 48AA(3) the person whose civil partnership has been dissolved is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the former civil partner's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 5 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) (Date 1 1 2018) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48AA(3) the person whose civil partnership has been dissolved is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the former civil partner's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) (Date 1 1 2014) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48AA(3) the person whose civil partnership has been dissolved is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the former civil partner's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) (Date 1 1 2018) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4) and (5): the Schedule 4 rate while the former spouse or civil partner is alive; the basic pension rate of section 44(4) (184.90) afterwards.
#ASSERT `s 48AA(4) the weekly rate of the Category B retirement pension in pounds` TRUE (JUST 110.5) EQUALS JUST 110.5
#ASSERT `s 48AA(4) the weekly rate of the Category B retirement pension in pounds` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 48AA(4) the weekly rate of the Category B retirement pension in pounds` FALSE (JUST 110.5) EQUALS JUST 184.9
#ASSERT `s 48AA(4) the weekly rate of the Category B retirement pension in pounds` FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST 184.9
-- (7): no account of earnings factors for 2016-17 or later.
