#ASSERT `s 48AA(8) the date on which the marriage or civil partnership is treated as dissolved` FALSE (Date 1 3 2005) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 48B: Category B retirement pension for widows and widowers`

-- (1ZB): paragraph 5 where the spouse died before 6 April 2010, or died on or after it having attained pensionable age before it; paragraph 5A otherwise.
#ASSERT `s 48B(1ZB) the relevant contribution condition` (`a person` Man (Date 1 1 1950) (Date 1 1 2015)) (Date 5 4 2010) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST `s 44(1A)(a) the conditions specified in Schedule 3, Part I, paragraph 5`
#ASSERT `s 48B(1ZB) the relevant contribution condition` (`a person` Man (Date 1 1 1950) (Date 5 4 2010)) (Date 6 4 2010) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST `s 44(1A)(a) the conditions specified in Schedule 3, Part I, paragraph 5`
#ASSERT `s 48B(1ZB) the relevant contribution condition` (`a person` Man (Date 1 1 1950) (Date 6 4 2010)) (Date 6 4 2010) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST `s 44(1A)(b) the condition specified in Schedule 3, Part I, paragraph 5A`
