#ASSERT `s 48B(1ZB) the relevant contribution condition` (`a person` Woman (Date 6 4 1945) (Date 1 1 2005)) (Date 1 1 2012) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST `s 44(1A)(b) the condition specified in Schedule 3, Part I, paragraph 5A`
#ASSERT `s 48B(1ZB) the relevant contribution condition` (`a person` Woman (Date 6 4 1945) (Date 1 1 2005)) (Date 1 1 2012) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 48B(1ZB) the relevant contribution condition` (`a person` Woman (Date 6 4 1945) (Date 1 1 2005)) (Date 5 4 2010) NOTHING EQUALS JUST `s 44(1A)(a) the conditions specified in Schedule 3, Part I, paragraph 5`
-- (1ZA): a man who attained pensionable age before 6 April 2010; a woman who did and whose spouse was a woman (unless section 51ZA(3) lifts it).
