#ASSERT `s 48B(1ZA) subsection (1) does not confer a right on the person` (`a person` Man (Date 1 1 1945) (Date 6 4 2010)) (`a person` Woman (Date 1 1 1950) (Date 1 1 2010)) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48B(1ZA) subsection (1) does not confer a right on the person` (`a person` Woman (Date 1 1 1945) (Date 5 4 2010)) (`a person` Woman (Date 1 1 1950) (Date 1 1 2010)) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
