#ASSERT `s 48B(1) the person whose spouse died is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) (Date 1 1 2017) TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 48B(1) the person whose spouse died is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 6 April 1950 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2015`) (Date 1 1 2017) TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
