-- A spouse who attained pensionable age before 6 April 2010 (a man here) needs paragraph 5.
#ASSERT `s 48B(1) the person whose spouse died is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a woman who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2013`) (`a man born 1 January 1940 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2005`) (Date 1 1 2017) TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
