#ASSERT `s 48B(1) the person whose spouse died is entitled to a Category B retirement pension by virtue of the spouse's contributions` (`a person` Woman (Date 1 1 1945) (Date 5 4 2010)) (`a woman born 1 January 1944 who attained pensionable age on 1 January 2004`) (Date 1 1 2012) TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
